    "description": "Body copy of the import-offer step -- states plainly that the old local data is replaced and saved to a backup file (spec §4). Wording adjusted (spec docs/feedback/2026-08-01-ux-audit.md A4) to drop 'kept only in an archive file', which implied an in-app restore that doesn't exist yet -- 'saved to a backup file' makes no such promise."
